Subject: Trung tâm Ánh Dương: You have used 16,500 of your 20,000 AI credits for November 2026

Trung tâm Ánh Dương

Hello Nguyễn Văn An,

You have used 16,500 of your 20,000 AI credits for November 2026, the share at which the centre warns its teachers.

You can see your balance in Settings › AI assistant:

https://portal.quizzivy.com/teacher/settings/ai

--
Change which emails you get:
https://portal.quizzivy.com/teacher/settings/notifications

